=2 Walkthrough
!The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah-map.jpg|right|Zi'Tah Map
!Ro'Maeve-map.jpg|right|Ro'Maeve
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Speak to {p:Cid} in the {z:Metalworks} (H-8) for a cutscene.
* You will be instructed to go to {z:Ro'Maeve}, which can be accessed from {z:The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah} at (F-5).
** Special caution is to be used in Ro'Maeve, as everything there will aggro {@a:Magic|Detects by Magic} magic. Most aggro {@a:Sound|Detects by Sound} sound and {@a:Sight|Detects by Sight} sight as well.
** {p:Unity Warp} (Level 125) will teleport you at (H-11).
** {p:Survival Guide} will teleport you at (H-6).
* You are looking for a **???**, which can spawn in the following locations, listed from west to east:
** (D-10), (E-9), (E-10/11), (G-9), (I-8), (J-8), (K-10), (K-11), (L-10) or (L-7).
*** **Notice:** The **???** at (M-8) is not related to this quest.
** The **???** will move approximately every 15 minutes, and can occur during the NM fight ahead.
* Check the **???** to spawn 2 {m:Golem} NMs named {m:Mokkurkalfi}.
** Despite Golems being {@a:Sight|Detects by Sight} sight aggro, you can {s:Sneak} pull these. However they are not overly difficult.
*** If sneak pulling, wait for the second {m:Golem} to despawn before defeating the first one.
** The **???** may have moved during the fight, and if so, simply find it again.
** You will not have to fight again __unless__ zoning or dying to the {m:Golems|Golem}.
* Check the **???** again to receive the {@k} {k:Reinforced cermet} Key Item.
* Return to {p:Cid} for another cutscene.

